Calculations for percentage differences between Current and Previous Years.

dax:
% YOY Sales Diff = DIVIDE([CY Sales] - [PY Sales], [PY Sales]) 

% YOY Profit Diff = DIVIDE([CY Profit] - [PY Profit], [PY Profit])

% YOY Quantity Diff = DIVIDE([CY Quantity] - [PY Quantity], [PY Quantity])

Scaled YoY for Visuals:
This measure scales the YoY percentage by the maximum sales to ensure it plots correctly on a secondary axis or specific chart limits.

% YOY Sales Diff - Scaled = 
VAR MaxSales = MAXX(ALLSELECTED(Products[Sub-Category]), [CY Sales])
RETURN [% YOY Sales Diff] * MaxSales

